@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/document-processing-service

### Full pipeline — summarize, split, extract and create in the review backend.
### Empty body falls back to srv/Invoice.pdf + a canned email.
POST {{baseUrl}}/processEmail
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Full pipeline with a real payload. `files[].content` and `email.content` are
### base64 (PDF bytes / HTML). email.content is stored as-is in Email.EmailBodyHtml.
POST {{baseUrl}}/processEmail
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "files": [
        {
            "name": "20260223 Memo to Finance_Payment to AOS ZICO.pdf",
            "content": ""
        }
    ],
    "email": {
        "subject": "Payment for Legal Sevices 2",
        "sender": "syaakir@abc.com.my",
        "sentDate": "2025-12-10T09:15:00Z",
        "content": ""
    }
}

### Verify what was created (local target)
GET http://localhost:4004/invoice-review/Email?$expand=_Invoice($expand=_Item,_Attachment)

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Individual stages, for debugging the pipeline one step at a time.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Summarize email — uses srv/Invoice.pdf as fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/summarizeEmail
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": {
        "subject": "Invoices for Legal",
        "content": ""
    }
}

### Get invoice pages — uses srv/Invoice.pdf as fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/getInvoicePages
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Extract invoice data — uses srv/Invoice_3.pdf as fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/extractInvoice
Content-Type: application/json

{}